    <item>
      <title>Version 1.0.5</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 00:29:35 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.0.5</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's new</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Automatic subtitle sync — Moonlit quietly checks external subtitles against the audio and corrects the timing on its own</li>
          <li>Redesigned subtitle panel — native glass panel with grouped Presets, Text, Position, and Outline & Shadow controls</li>
          <li>Subtitles now lift out of the way automatically when playback controls are visible, for embedded and external tracks alike</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
